{"data": [{"author_id": "1542705203320745985", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:09:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117000985914888259"], "id": "2117000985914888259", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 306, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "こういう時在宅に出来るウチの会社\n融通が聞いて良い", "url": "https://x.com/minazuki_vrchat/status/2117000985914888259"}, {"author_id": "730317517210550272", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:36:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117234267134591452"], "id": "2117234267134591452", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 216, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "不是怕你亏，是社融和险资都深度套里面了，不让它们出来的话，它们是真能造反的。 https://t.co/EypAgKdCSJ", "url": "https://x.com/X_X_MAN_/status/2117234267134591452"}, {"author_id": "61542451", "created_at": "2026-11-03T05:05:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117483157201289652"], "id": "2117483157201289652", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 107, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "央行十一月二号做了五千四百一十亿隔夜逆回购，利率一点二五，新日常隔夜框架落地。外场飞了二十年，燃油价一变你就得重算航程。你会先看短端资金松不松，还是等下周社融再说？", "url": "https://x.com/SicanianSun/status/2117483157201289652"}, {"author_id": "1829889395916488704", "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:31:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117052003608326165"], "id": "2117052003608326165", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 175, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "本日の日経MJより。\n\n米粉製品数、5年で4倍／富澤商店、菓子作り用ミックス粉も\n\nUSMH、100店閉店のワケ／総菜改革へ4社融合／老いる店舗、投資回らず\n\n「エアリズムマスク」再販、レビューの力／ユニクロ、顧客の要望でサイズ・色も充実\n\n災害時「在宅避難を希望」72.5%", "url": "https://x.com/ichikawa_mk_lab/status/2117052003608326165"}, {"author_id": "1357355554096742400", "created_at": "2026-11-02T07:40:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117159939432984878"], "id": "2117159939432984878", "public_metrics": {"bookma